This repository contains the data preprocessing, tokenizer, pretraining,
post-training, conversion and evaluation code of the Luciole language models,
developed by LINAGORA within the OpenLLM-France consortium.
PROJET FRANCE2030 OpenLLM-France, funded by Bpifrance under the call
"Communs numériques pour l'intelligence artificielle générative".

The Luciole models (Luciole-1B/8B/23B-Base, Luciole-1B/8B/23B-Instruct-1.1,
Luciole-23B-Thinking-1.1, Luciole-8B-KD-Math-Base,
Luciole-8B-KD-Math-Thinking-1.1 and their quantized builds) and the
Luciole-Training-Dataset are the property of LINAGORA SAS and are released
under the Apache License 2.0 (models) and CC-BY-SA-4.0 (dataset).
The Luciole-PostTraining-Dataset-1.1 is jointly owned by LINAGORA SAS and
OPINIONSCIENCE SAS and released under CC-BY-SA-4.0.

